msgid "Main build system: Working with SCons"
msgstr "主要建置系統：使用 SCons"

msgid ""
"This page documents how to compile godot-cpp. If you're looking to compile "
"Godot instead, see :ref:`doc_introduction_to_the_buildsystem`."
msgstr ""
"本頁文件介紹了如何編譯 godot-cpp。如果你想編譯 Godot，請參"
"閱 :ref:`doc_introduction_to_the_buildsystem`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"`godot-cpp <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp>`__ uses `SCons "
"<https://scons.org>`__ as its main build system. It is modeled "
"after :ref:`Godot's build system <doc_compiling_index>`, and some commands "
"available there are also available in godot-cpp projects."
msgstr ""
"`godot-cpp <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp>`__ 採用 `SCons "
"<https://scons.org>`__ 作為其主要建置系統。該系統的設計仿照了 :ref:`Godot 的"
"建置系統 <doc_compiling_index>`，因此 Godot 中可用的部分命令在 godot-cpp 專案"
"中同樣適用。"

msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "入門"

msgid ""
"To build a godot-cpp project, it is generally sufficient to install `SCons "
"<https://scons.org>`__, and simply run it in the project directory:"
msgstr ""
"要建置一個 godot-cpp 專案，通常只需安裝 `SCons <https://scons.org>`__\\ ，然"
"後在專案目錄中直接執行以下命令："

msgid "scons"
msgstr "scons"

msgid "You may want to learn about available options:"
msgstr "你可能需要瞭解可用的建置選項："

msgid "scons --help"
msgstr "scons --help"

msgid ""
"To cleanly re-build your project, add ``--clean`` to your build command:"
msgstr "若要徹底重新建置你的專案，請在建置命令中新增 ``--clean`` 參數："

msgid "scons --clean"
msgstr "scons --clean"

msgid ""
"You can find more information about common SCons arguments and build "
"patterns in the `SCons User Guide <https://scons.org/doc/latest/HTML/scons-"
"user/index.html>`__. Additional commands may be added by individual godot-"
"cpp projects, so consult their specific documentation for more information "
"on those."
msgstr ""
"關於常見的 SCons 參數和建置模式，你可以在 `SCons 使用者指南 <https://"
"scons.org/doc/latest/HTML/scons-user/index.html>`__ 中找到更多資訊。此外，各"
"個 godot-cpp 專案可能會新增額外的自訂命令，因此請查閱具體專案的文件以取得更多"
"相關資訊。"

msgid "Configuring an IDE"
msgstr "設定 IDE"

msgid ""
"Most IDEs can use a ``compile_commands.json`` file to understand a C++ "
"project. You can generate it with godot-cpp using the following command:"
msgstr ""
"大多數集成開發環境（IDE）可以通過讀取 ``compile_commands.json`` 檔案來解析 C+"
"+ 專案結構。你可以使用以下命令，通過 godot-cpp 生成此檔案："

msgid ""
"For more information, please check out the :ref:`IDE configuration guides "
"<doc_configuring_an_ide>`. Although written for Godot engine contributors, "
"they are largely applicable to godot-cpp projects as well."
msgstr ""
"如需瞭解更多資訊，請查閱 :ref:`IDE 設定指南 <doc_configuring_an_ide>`\\ 。儘"
"管該指南主要面向 Godot 引擎貢獻者編寫，但其內容大部分同樣適用於 godot-cpp 專"
"案。"

msgid "Loading your GDExtension in Godot"
msgstr "在 Godot 中載入你的 GDExtension"

msgid ""
"Godot loads GDExtensions by finding :ref:`.gdextension "
"<doc_gdextension_file>` files in the project directory. ``.gdextension`` "
"files are used to select and load a binary compatible with the current "
"computer / operating system."
msgstr ""
"Godot 通過在專案目錄中尋找 :ref:`.gdextension <doc_gdextension_file>` 檔案來"
"載入 GDExtension。\\ ``.gdextension`` 檔案用於選擇並載入與目前電腦/作業系統相"
"容的二進位檔案。"

msgid ""
"The `godot-cpp-template <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp-"
"template>`__, as well as the :ref:`Getting Started section "
"<doc_godot_cpp_getting_started>`, provide example ``.gdextension`` files for "
"GDExtensions that are widely compatible to many different systems."
msgstr ""
"`godot-cpp-template <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp-template>`__ 以"
"及 :ref:`入門章節 <doc_godot_cpp_getting_started>` 都提供了用於 GDExtension "
"的範例 ``.gdextension`` 檔案，這些檔案能與多種不同系統廣泛相容。"

msgid "Building for multiple platforms"
msgstr "為多平台建置"

msgid ""
"GDExtensions are expected to run on many different systems, each with "
"separate binaries and build configurations. If you are planning to publish "
"your GDExtension, we recommend you provide binaries for all configurations "
"that are mentioned in the `godot-cpp-template <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-cpp-template>`__ `.gdextension file <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-cpp-template/blob/main/demo/bin/example.gdextension>`__."
msgstr ""
"GDExtension 需要能在多種不同的系統上執行，每個系統都需要單獨的二進位檔案和建"
"置設定。如果你計劃發佈你的 GDExtension，我們建議你為 `godot-cpp-template "
"<https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp-template>`__ ` 中 `.gdextension "
"file <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp-template/blob/main/demo/bin/"
"example.gdextension>`__ 所提及的所有設定都提供相應的二進位檔案。"

msgid ""
"There are two popular ways by which cross platform builds can be achieved:"
msgstr "有兩種常用的方法可以實現跨平台建置："

msgid "Cross-platform build tools"
msgstr "跨平台建置工具"

msgid "Continuous Integration (CI)"
msgstr "持續集成（CI）"

msgid ""
"`godot-cpp-template <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp-template>`__ "
"contains an `example setup <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp-"
"template/tree/main/.github/workflows>`__ for a GitHub based CI workflow."
msgstr ""
"`godot-cpp-template <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp-template>`__ 包"
"含了一個基於 GitHub 的 CI 工作流的 `範例設定 <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot-cpp-template/tree/main/.github/workflows>`__\\ 。"

msgid "Using a custom API file"
msgstr "使用自訂 API 檔案"

msgid ""
"Every branch of godot-cpp comes with an API file (``extension_api.json``) "
"appropriate for the respective Godot version (e.g. the ``4.3`` branch comes "
"with the API file compatible with Godot version ``4.3`` and later)."
msgstr ""
"每個 godot-cpp 分支都附帶一個適用於相應 Godot 版本的 API 檔案（\\ "
"``extension_api.json``\\ ）（例如，\\ ``4.3`` 分支附帶與 Godot 版本 ``4.3`` "
"及更高版本相容的 API 檔案）。"

msgid ""
"However, you may want to use a custom ``extension_api.json``, for example:"
msgstr ""
"不過，在某些情況下你可能希望使用自訂的 ``extension_api.json``\\ ，例如："

msgid "If you want to use the latest APIs from Godot ``master``."
msgstr "如果你希望使用來自 Godot ``master`` 分支的最新 API。"

msgid ""
"If you :ref:`build Godot yourself <doc_compiling_index>` with different "
"options than the official builds (e.g. ``disable_3d=yes`` or "
"``precision=double``)."
msgstr ""
"如果你 :ref:`自行建置 <doc_compiling_index>`\\ ，並且使用了與官方建置不同的選"
"項（例如 ``disable_3d=yes`` 或 ``precision=double``\\ ）。"

msgid "If you want to use APIs exposed by custom modules."
msgstr "如果你希望使用由自訂模組暴露的 API。"

msgid ""
"To use a custom API file, you first have to generate it from the appropriate "
"Godot executable:"
msgstr "要使用自訂 API 檔案，首先需要從相應的 Godot 可執行檔生成它："

msgid ""
"The resulting ``extension_api.json`` file will be created in the "
"executable's directory. To use it, you can add ``custom_api_file`` to your "
"build command:"
msgstr ""
"生成的 ``extension_api.json`` 檔案將位於可執行檔的目錄下。想要使用它，你可以"
"在建置命令中新增 ``custom_api_file`` 選項。"

msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can add it as the default API file to your project by "
"adding the following line to your SConstruct file:"
msgstr ""
"或者，你也可以通過在 SConstruct 檔案中新增以下一行，將其設定為專案的預設 API "
"檔案："

msgid "Modifying generated files"
msgstr "修改生成的檔案"

msgid ""
"If you have to modify the files generated by godot-cpp, its *hook system* is "
"the right way of doing so. We provide the ``BindingGeneratorHooks`` class, "
"located at ``godot-cpp/tools/binding_generator_hooks.py``. Your custom hooks "
"are a python class that extends ``BindingGeneratorHooks`` and overrides "
"(some of) its methods. After defining your subclass, you should export an "
"instance of it from your ``SConstruct`` with the key ``binding_hooks`` to "
"godot-cpp's ``SConstruct``. This way you let godot-cpp's ``SConstruct`` know "
"about your class, see the example below for one way of doing this."
msgstr ""
"若您需要修改由 `godot-cpp` 生成的檔案，那麼其內建的 *Hook 系統* 是實現這一目"
"標的正確方式。我們提供了 ` ``BindingGeneratorHooks`` ` 類，該類位於 ` "
"``godot-cpp/tools/binding_generator_hooks.py``. ` 目錄下；您的自訂 Hook 實際"
"上是一個繼承自 ` ``BindingGeneratorHooks`` ` 並覆寫了其部分方法的 Python 類。"
"定義好您的子類別後，應將該子類別的實例通過鍵值 ` ``binding_hooks`` ` 從您的 "
"` ``SConstruct`` ` 檔案匯出至 `godot-cpp` 的 ` ``SConstruct`` ` 檔案中。通過"
"這種方式，`godot-cpp` 的 ` ``SConstruct`` ` 檔案便能識別到您的自訂類——請參閱"
"下例以瞭解具體實現方法。"

msgid "Example"
msgstr "範例"

msgid ""
"This example adds a string constant of every signal in a class to its class "
"header. For example, in ``base_button.hpp`` we will add ``static constexpr "
"char SIGNAL_PRESSED[] = \"pressed\";`` for the ``pressed`` signal. We will "
"use the ``SConstruct`` file from the `godot-cpp template <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-cpp-template>`__. We start by creating "
"`custom_generator.py` at the root of our project. It only overrides "
"``alter_engine_class_header``, as that is all we need."
msgstr ""
"本範例將為類中的每個訊號新增一個字串常數到其類頭中。例如，在 "
"``base_button.hpp`` 中，我們將為 ``pressed`` 訊號新增 ``static constexpr "
"char SIGNAL_PRESSED[] = “pressed”；`` 。我們將使用來自 `godot-cpp template "
"<https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp-template>`__. 的 ``SConstruct`` 檔"
"案。首先，我們在專案根目錄下建立一個 `custom_generator.py` 檔案；該檔案僅覆"
"蓋 ``alter_engine_class_header`` ，因為這正是我們所需的內容。"

msgid "custom_generator.py"
msgstr "custom_generator.py"

msgid "Next, we import the class in our ``SConstruct`` file:"
msgstr "接下來，我們在 ``SConstruct`` 檔案中匯入該類："

msgid ""
"Additionally, we edit the line that exports variables to ``godot-cpp/"
"SConstruct`` to include an instance of our class, like so:"
msgstr ""
"此外，我們對將變數匯出至 ``godot-cpp/SConstruct`` 的那行程式碼進行修改，使其"
"包含一個我們自訂類的實例，具體如下："

msgid ""
"This is everything you need, when you regenerate the files they should "
"contain signal name constants for all signals in the API file."
msgstr ""
"這包含了您所需的一切；當您重新生成檔案時，這些檔案應包含 API 檔案中所有訊號對"
"應的訊號名稱常數。"
